  "packaging_notes": [
    "Model directories are overlays for the pinned upstream revisions; source_sha256 identifies the local research source and release_sha256 identifies the packaged file.",
    "Host-specific paths were replaced with portable defaults or explicit CLI/configuration paths. SGCS helper imports use the public sgcs_eval module name.",
    "WorldMem supports public ABA directory naming, resolves the shared metric with LOOPNAV_METRICS_DIR, and defaults to the 20000-step configuration. Real-data tests are opt-in.",
    "OASIS initializes model weights after argument parsing and accepts checkpoint/device arguments.",
    "NWM preprocessing now writes the trajectory pickle and unpadded JPEG filenames required by the pinned upstream dataset loader; training metric dependencies are listed separately.",
    "The frozen 720-sample manifest replaces local one-off selection/repair scripts. Archived score exports preserve original source-result hashes.",
    "Repository layout: collection, quality, models, evaluation, benchmark, and docs. Runtime paths, shared imports, result-manifest links, and documentation were updated for this organization; benchmark scores are unchanged."
